Value List LOCAL_INTERFACE
Value List NEIGHBOR_ID
Value List NEIGHBOR_PORT
Value List NEIGHBOR_NAME

Start
  ^\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*Local Interface.* -> SkipHeader
  ^\s*---+.* -> SkipHeader

SkipHeader
  ^\s*${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${NEIGHBOR_ID}\s+${NEIGHBOR_PORT}\s+${NEIGHBOR_NAME}$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$ -> Start
